## 4. Not applied / applied differently, and why

1. b#42 «κύρια εγκατάσταση» -> «έδρα» (018): NOT applied as a term swap. «κύρια εγκατάσταση» is the
   locale-wide rendering of 本店 in 001/004/017/018, and R8 requires one name per locale; the tax term
   PE is rendered separately as «μόνιμη εγκατάσταση (常設機構)», so there is no collision. I did fix the
   real error in the quoted sentence: «διάφορες απαιτήσεις» -> «διάφορα αιτήματα» (要求 = requests).
2. a#18 «εύρος»: applied only to the calque collocation «εύρος της εργασίας»/«εύρος εργασίας». Bare
   «εύρος» (= scope/extent) is idiomatic Greek and is pinned by src/lib/__tests__/international-guidance-
   answers.test.ts (SERVICES_SCOPE_TERMS.el = /εύρος/), so «Το εύρος κάθε υπόθεσης επιβεβαιώνεται χωριστά»
   was kept as is.
3. a#31 «Επιφυλάξεις» -> «Αποποίηση ευθύνης»: the nav label is capped at 14 characters by
   src/lib/__tests__/guidance-cs-hu-ro-uk-el-he-content.test.ts (a layout invariant, not a pinned string,
   so I did not touch the test). Result: nav.disclaimer = «Αποποίηση» (9 chars), page eyebrow =
   «ΑΠΟΠΟΙΗΣΗ ΕΥΘΥΝΗΣ».
4. a#42 ISO date: «29.5.2026» made checkNumbers FAIL (missing 5, 7, 2026×2 — the checker cannot parse the
   dotted form). Used «29/5/2026» and «1/7/2026», which the checker accepts and which is the d/m/yyyy form
   already used throughout the same file (27/12/2023, 5/6/2026).
5. Three digit-words had to stay digits for the checker (noted per the WO): «1η τάξη της νόμιμης
   κληρονομίας» (016, ×2 — Korean 제1순위) and «πρωτογενείς πηγές (πηγές 1ου επιπέδου)» (007 — Korean 1차),
   and «ιδίως 1 μικρό φορτηγό» (017, ×2). Everything else became a word.
6. b#6 / R7b: the English source headings for 014 §1, 016 §3/§7 and 017 §3 are topic headings, and the
   English bodies also open with a bare "No." — so, per R7b's second option, I made the Greek first
   sentence self-standing («Δεν ισχύει αυτομάτως.», «Όχι, δεν πρόκειται για το ίδιο δικαίωμα.»,
   «Όχι, δεν μπορεί να τη χρησιμοποιεί ελευθέρως.», «Όχι, η άδεια δεν μεταβιβάζεται αυτομάτως.») and kept
   the heading count. 014 §1 also got ACCEPTED's «…πότε είναι εκτελεστό…» wording.
7. a#37 «ισοπόσως»: used the Demotic adverb «ισόποσα» rather than only restoring the accent (the whole
   locale was moved off Katharevousa).
8. 003 «άνευ πταίσματος» (無過失給付制度) kept — «ευθύνη άνευ πταίσματος» is standard Greek legal usage.
9. 010 «Κορεάτης φοιτητής …» in the two press-headline link labels/alt texts kept verbatim: it is a real
   news headline and the underlying TWD 1,570,000 first-instance judgment is the attorney-approved fact.
10. b#39: place names transliterated (Κινμέν / Λιεντσιάνγκ / Ματσού) with the Chinese glosses kept.
11. 010 prescription passage: the global αποσβέννυται->λύεται sweep was wrong there (消滅時效), corrected by
